max-loaded-objects: MAX_LOADED_OBJECTS = 16

Classification: profile setting.

tpm-rs implements 16 transient object slots (TPM_PT_HR_TRANSIENT_MIN,
TRANSIENT_LAST = TRANSIENT_FIRST + 15), so the reference gets as many;
otherwise TPM_RC_OBJECT_MEMORY would be returned at different points.

diff --git a/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h b/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
--- a/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
+++ b/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
@@ -80,7 +80,9 @@
 #define MAX_ACTIVE_SESSIONS        64
 #define MAX_LOADED_SESSIONS        3
 #define MAX_SESSION_NUM            3
-#define MAX_LOADED_OBJECTS         3
+// tpm-rs differential testing: tpm-rs implements 16 transient object slots
+// (so TRANSIENT_LAST = TRANSIENT_FIRST + 15, Part 2 handle constants).
+#define MAX_LOADED_OBJECTS         16
 #define MIN_EVICT_OBJECTS          7	/* kgold for PC client */
 #define NUM_POLICY_PCR_GROUP       1
 #define NUM_AUTHVALUE_PCR_GROUP    1
